<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Jan 6.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Jan 6.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
